    "semanticRules": [
      "`PK(workspace_id,material_handle_id)`",
      "`UNIQUE(workspace_id,relative_path)`",
      "`rowMutability=cas_lifecycle`且只允许幂等filesystem cleanup effect以expected Handle fence执行一次`active→reclaimed`，三个reclaimed列在active时全NULL、terminal时全非NULL且write-once",
      "同一inode的hard-link location允许共享materialKey但必须是不同Handle/relative path",
      "endpoint/mount scope必须等于Workspace root snapshot",
      "完整Physical Identity由Workspace write effect在同一Effect commit按实际文件stat+sha256形成，`material_key`必须按8.6.18公式重算",
      "路径必须通过containment validator",
      "Domain Cleanup Commit只读取该terminal row/Evidence并收口Libra Reference/Control，不再次删除bytes或改写本row"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`workspace_id FK, material_handle_id, material_key, endpoint_id, mount_scope_id, inode, content_hash_algorithm, content_hash, relative_path, digest_algorithm, digest_hex, size_bytes, reference_revision, state(active|reclaimed), reclaimed_effect_id NULL, reclaimed_effect_receipt_digest NULL, reclaimed_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "`PK(workspace_id,material_handle_id)`；`UNIQUE(workspace_id,relative_path)`；`rowMutability=cas_lifecycle`且只允许幂等filesystem cleanup effect以expected Handle fence执行一次`active→reclaimed`，三个reclaimed列在active时全NULL、terminal时全非NULL且write-once；同一inode的hard-link location允许共享materialKey但必须是不同Handle/relative path；endpoint/mount scope必须等于Workspace root snapshot；完整Physical Identity由Workspace write effect在同一Effect commit按实际文件stat+sha256形成，`material_key`必须按8.6.18公式重算；路径必须通过containment validator；Domain Cleanup Commit只读取该terminal row/Evidence并收口Libra Reference/Control，不再次删除bytes或改写本row"
    },
